{"id":"f2434afaa125d50e","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-free-variable.md","title":"Free Variable","display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-free-variable","aliases":["57-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","depends_on":["[[57-df-var-in-term]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — Free Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"16a587bb999452b8\" href=\"?note=16a587bb999452b8\" title=\"57-df-var-in-term\">57-df-var-in-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>公式及项变量函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16a587bb999452b8\" href=\"?note=16a587bb999452b8\" title=\"57-df-var-in-term\">57-df-var-in-term</a>；变量和符号分量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 是已有调用使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}\\)</span> 别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{free}(t_1\\doteq t_2)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t_2),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{free}(t_1\\doteq t_2)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t_2),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{var}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按有限树递归，无需先定义代入、二阶公式或矢列。去除这些反向依赖不会改动自由变量集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-var-in-term","status":"resolved","id":"16a587bb999452b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-var-in-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading"