{Var}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$；代入见 [[57-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\mathrm{FreeFor}$ 见 [[57-df-free-for]]，$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。"},{"id":"4ed02595a2cb4caa","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定互异变量列 $\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle$；$\\mathrm{free}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]，$\\mathrm{All}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]，$\\models$ 见 [[57-df-logical-consequence]]。$S_0$ 和 $\\vec x$ 是本二元接口的显式环境参数。"},{"id":"b0fd90af076efa92","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$；代入见 [[57-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\mathrm{FreeFor}$ 见 [[57-df-free-for]]，$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。"},{"id":"1f550822d0e6a763","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$；代入见 [[57-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\mathrm{FreeFor}$ 见 [[57-df-free-for]]，$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。"},{"id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}$ 是显式固定的候选支持映射，其定义域包含当前候选载体，且 $\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}$；$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 时采用 [[57-df-free-variable]] 的映射。此映射是本谓词的环境参数，不存在于载体外的未声明自由调用。"},{"id":"8216e0b1a4cf9570","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}$、$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$、$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{FV}$、$\\mathrm{var}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]、[[57-df-var-in-term]]，语法见 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}$，$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。"},{"id":"341dd891eed2b080","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"52897755c29c065c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}(\\Gamma)$、$\\mathrm{Fr